## What this license covers

This repository contains the source code of **Guia de Bolso**, a production
product operated at https://guiadebolso.app.

The **Guia de Bolso** name, logo, visual identity, marketing materials, and
production data (places, partners, contracts, user accounts) are proprietary
and are **not** licensed for reuse.

## What you may do

You may:

- Fork this repository to study the architecture
- Run a **private** local or staging instance for learning, evaluation, or
  contributing a pull request
- Submit patches under the contribution guidelines

## What you may not do

You may not, without prior written permission from the copyright holder:

- Use the Guia de Bolso name, logo, or trade dress
- Deploy a public competing service that presents itself as Guia de Bolso
- Redistribute production catalog data, partner contracts, or user data
- Sell, sublicense, or offer this codebase as a commercial product

